[Music]  this week's 48 hours investigates the  suspicious death of amy harwick the  hollywood therapist and former fiancee  of drew carey host of the prices right  here on cbs  police found harwick unresponsive at her  home the morning after valentine's day  back in 2020 her suspected killer is  ex-boyfriend gareth pursehouse who has  been charged with her murder he has pled  not guilty drew carey spoke with 48  hours correspondent erin moriarty in his  first extensive tv interview about  harwick's death  in the hours just after valentine's day  in 2020 drew carey's former fiance amy  harwick a hollywood therapist lost her  life  obviously really beautiful  like she was smart she had a phd  master's degree she cared so much about  helping people that's that was her  life's purpose drew and amy met in 2017.  i felt so hard for her and a year later  to mark valentine's day he shared news  of their engagement my brand new lovely  fiancee amy still like many hollywood  romances theirs didn't last and they  broke up and fell out of touch and then  out of the blue just two days before her  death amy reached out i got a text from  her and would love to get together with  you and talk  and i said yeah i would love to do that  i love you are you sad you never got  that chance i never got it i never got a  chance to do it  on the last night of her life  valentine's day amy was out with friends  and took these photos not long after  police found amy lying below her bedroom  balcony fighting to breathe there were  deep marks on her neck signs that she  had been strangled inside blood on a  door and on the balcony a syringe like  this one containing a liquid that lab  tests later revealed to be nicotine  which can be a lethal poison  amy died on february 15 at 3 26 a.m  amy's friend robert koshland  i would say it was like the sun was  ripped from the sky  caution reached out to drew carey and i  just started crying you know  really bad coughlin says he instantly  knew who might have done this to amy an  ex-boyfriend gareth pursehouse whom amy  had reported for assaulting her before  they broke up in 2012.  she feared he was stalking her she  literally said if anything ever happens  to me it's gareth pursehouse's dna was  found on amy's fingernails and in her  home he was charged with her murder  purse house has pleaded not guilty  drew carey says he's grateful for that  last text exchange with amy and she did  love you because that's what i've heard  and that's the only  that's the big solace i get from it is  that she loved me and i'm glad i could  get that message to her  before she died  and aaron moriarty joins us now erin  good morning uh drew carey has not said  much about this uh why do you think he's  speaking now well i mean as you could  see even from that small piece she was  an extraordinary woman i think it's very  difficult to talk about her loss but i  think that not just drew carey but a lot  of her friends are now speaking out  because they really want to call  attention to stalking particularly  intimate partner stalking i think and  this weekend could not be a more perfect  time believe it or not valentine's day  can be a trigger and it probably was a  trigger in amy harwick's case who is  this accused murderer gareth pursehouse  well on the face of it he's a  photographer that she knew  and he's also a software engineer  but he's not just an ex-boyfriend he's  an xxx boyfriend a couple of years ago  yeah i noticed that you had talked about  that and so he is somebody that she had  not  seen  over eight years although she did think  that he might be stalking her and then  just one month before her death they had  this on you know unplanned encounter and  he suddenly starts quoting verbatim  texts she had sent him eight years  earlier so even though he says he had  nothing to do with her murder there's  evidence that he was obsessed yeah he's  accused but he has pleaded not guilty  all right aaron thank you very much it's  going to be a fascinating report you can  see aaron's full report the final hours  of amy harwick tomorrow night at 10 9  central right here on cbs and on our  streaming service paramount plus  and on the cbs news streaming network

